        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላችሁ ፤ ውእተ፡ አሚረ፡ ይሠርቅ፡ ፀሐየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽድቅ፡ ወሕይወት፡ ታሕተ ፡ ክነፊሁ ፡ ያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለው። ሐተታ፡ነቢይ፡ ቢል፡ የተመቸ፡ ነቢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያት፡ ቢል፡ መጽሐፍ ፡ ስም ፡ ካልጠራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማብዛት ፡ ልማዱ ፡ ነውና ፡ (ወእምከመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥቀ) ፡ ከጊዜው ፡ ብትደርሱ ፡ አብራች",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁ፡ ብትወጡ፡ ብትወርዱ ፡ (ወትኔጽርዎ)፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መልኩን ፡ ብታዩ ፡ (ይከውን ፡ ለክሙ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጨለማ ፡ ቦታ ፡ እንደሚያበራ ፡ ፋና ፡ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆንላችኋል፡(እስከ፡ታበርህ) ፡ዕለተ፡ዐርብ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስትትገለጽላችሁ፡ ድረስ ፡ (ወይሠርቅ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቤዛ፡ክርስቶስ፡በልቡናችሁ፡ እስኪያድርባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true,
          "stage1_text": "ቤዝ፡ክርስቶስ፡በልቡናችሁ፡ እስኪያድርባ",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "ቤዝ -> ቤዛ",
            "reason": "The printed glyph is 4th-order ዛ ('ቤዛ ክርስቶስ', Christ the Redeemer/Daystar), misread as 6th-order ዝ."
          },
          "uncertain": []
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ችሁ፡ድረስ ። አንድም፡ከመዝ፡ይቤ፡ሙሴ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመዝ ፡ ይቤ፡ ሳሙኤል ፡ እንደሚሉ ፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደ ፡ ደቂቀ ፡ ነቢያት ፡ አልነገርናችሁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ምግባር ፡ ትሩፋት ፡ ሠርተን ፡ ከመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓርገ፡ ነጽሮ፡ ደርሰን ፡ በቅተን፡ ነገርናችሁ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትላለህ ፡ እንጅ ፡ መብቃትህን ፡ ማን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያውቅልሃል ፡ ትሉኝ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ ይህ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንስ ፡ የሚያስረዳ ፡ የሚያሳውቅ ፡ የነቢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያት ፡ ቃል ፡ አለላችሁ ፤ (ነቢያት ፡ የተና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገሩት ፡ ቃልም ፡ ቢል ፡ አንድ ፡ ነው) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕዝቅኤል ፡ በሦስት ፡ ኅብር ፡ የተሠራች፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አዳራሽ ፡ አይቷል ፡ በኅብረ ፡ ማይ ፡ በኅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብረ ፡ ሰማይ ፡ በኅብረ ፡ በረድ ፡ ንጉሥ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከላይዋ ፡ ላይ ፡ ተቀምጦባት ፡ ኅብረ ፡ማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይና ፡ ኅብረ ፡ በረድሱ ፡ አንድ ፡ ወገን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ ብሎ ፡ በኅብረ ፡ ባሕርይ ፡ ም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳሌ ፡ ነው ፡ ንጉሥ ፡ የመንፈስ ፡ ቅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዱስ ፡ አዳራሽ ፡ የሐዋርያት ፡ ሦስቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኅብር ፡ የንጽሐ ፡ ሥጋ ፡ የንጽሐ ፡ ነፍስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የንጽሐ ፡ ልቡና ፡ (ታሤንዩ) ፡ ከመም",
