          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለማ፡ ቦታ፡ እንደምታበራ፡ፋና፡ይሆንላችኋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ል ፡ ዕለተ፡ ትንሣኤ፡ እስትትገለጽላችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድረስ፡ አእምሮ፡ መንፈሳዊም፡እስኪፈጸም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላችሁ፡ ድረስ። ሐተታ፡ ነጋድያን፡ በባሕር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመርከብ ፡ ሲሄዱ ፡ ውለው ፡ ሌሊት፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዲያውን፡ዝም፡ብለን፡እናድራለን፡ ብለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከአዝማደ፡አእባን፡ ከአዝማደ፡ ሐፃውንት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቡላድ ፡ መተው ፡ መብራት፡ አብርተው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲሠሩ፡ ያድራሉ ፡ ሌሊት፡ የሠሩት፡ ቀን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሠሩት ፡ ተካክሎ ፡ ዋጋ ፡ ያወጣላቸዋል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደዚህም ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ውሉደ ፡ ሌሊት ፡ ነቢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያት ፡ ከውሉደ ፡ መዓልት ፡ ከሐዋርያት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጋራ ፡ ተካክለው ፡ ዋጋ ፡ ማግኘታቸውን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መናገር ፡ ነው ፡ ከሰው ፡ የሚገኘውን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕውቀት ፡ በፋና ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የሚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገኘውን ፡ በፀሐይ፡መስሎ፡ተናገረ፡ (ጥቅ)፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሃይማኖት፡እንተ፡ትጠረይ፡ እምትምህሮ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢታግዕዞ ፡ ለሰብእ ፡ እምኑፋቄ ፡ ወእም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትሕዝብት ፡ እንዲል ፡ መዝ ፡ ፻፲፱ ፥ ፻፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፡ ቆሮ ፥ ፬ ፥ ፮ ።",
