          "text": "ዕወቁ ፡ ቅዱሳን ፡ ሐዋርያት ፡ በመንፈስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅዱስ፡ ተገልጾላቸው፡ አስተማሩ ፡ እንጅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ ፡ ቦ ፡ ሐሳውያነ ፡ ነቢያት ፡ ብለህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግጠም ፡ ቀድሞ ፡ በሕዝቡ ፡ መካከል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐሰተኞች ፡ መምህራን ፡ እንደ ፡ ነበሩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዛሬም ፡ በናንተ ፡ መካከል ፡ ሐሰትን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚያስተምሩ ፡ ሐሰተኞች ፡ መምህራን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእለ ፡ ክሕደ ፡ ያበውኡ ፡ ለሕርትምና ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥፋት ፡ ሊሆንባቸው ። አንድም ፡ ጥፋት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሊመጣባቸው ፡ በሰው ፡ ልቡና ፡ ክህደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትን ፡ የሚያሳድሩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይክሕድዎ ፡ ለእግዚኦሙ ፡ ዘተሣየጦሙ ፡ በደሙ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በወርቀ ፡ ደሙ ፡ የዋጃቸው ፡ ፈጣሪያቸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ፡ የሚክዱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያመጽእዋ ፡ ላዕሌሆሙ ፡ ፍጡነ ፡ ለሙስና ፡ ወለተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሠርዎ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥፋትን ፡ መነቀልን ፡ በራሳቸው ፡ ፈጥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ የሚያመጡ ፡ መተከልን ፡ መደብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አድርጎላቸው ፡ መነቀልን ፡ የሚያመጡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ ማቴ ፥ ፳፬ ፥ ፲፩ ። ፩ ፡ ጢሞ ፥ ፬ ፥ ፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፪ ፤ ወብዙኃን ፡ ሰብእ ፡ ይተልውዎሙ ፡ ለእሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእንተ ፡ ፍትወተ ፡ ዝሙቶሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሊህንም ፡ ዝሙታቸውን ፡ ስለ ፡ መው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደድ ፡ ብዙ ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ይመስሏቸዋል ፡ አለ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አብነት ፡ ያደርጓቸዋል ፡",
